Description: A comprehensive collection of categorical clustering methods including
    AAC (Alpha-19) algorithm in sequential, parallel, and Rcpp variants, hierarchical
    methods (Ward, DIANA), density-based methods (DBSCAN, HDBSCAN), Spectral Clustering,
     and POP (Partitioning Around PAMoids). Includes Quality
    Index (QI) evaluation for categorical partitions and silhouette analysis.
